### Extra options

You can override the language. Otherwise the plugin uses the system
language.

  "tts": {
    "module": "ovos-tts-plugin-google-tx",
    "ovos-tts-plugin-google-tx": {
      "slow": false,
      "lang": "fr",
      "tld": "ca"
    }
  }

Set the `tld` option to [force an accent](https://gtts.readthedocs.io/en/latest/module.html#localized-accents).
This option also helps when a network blocks `google.com` but allows a
local or different Google host.

The plugin recognizes the following regional accents and dialects, and
picks the matching `tld` for each:

{
  "tts": {
    "module": "ovos-tts-plugin-kokoro",
    "ovos-tts-plugin-kokoro": {
      "voice": "af_bella"
    }
  }
}

### Voice options

Kokoro ships 56 built-in voices across 9 languages. The voice id encodes language + gender:

| Prefix | Language             | Examples                                    |
| ------ | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| `af_`  | American English (F) | `af_bella`, `af_heart`, `af_nicole`         |
| `am_`  | American English (M) | `am_michael`, `am_onyx`, `am_eric`          |
| `bf_`  | British English (F)  | `bf_alice`, `bf_emma`, `bf_lily`            |
| `bm_`  | British English (M)  | `bm_george`, `bm_fable`, `bm_daniel`        |
| `jf_` / `jm_` | Japanese      | `jf_alpha`, `jm_kumo` *(needs `[ja]` extra)* |
| `…

